{
  "title": "Kenyan Meat Skewers",
  "description": "A crowd-pleasing Kenyan dish featuring charred meat and glassy jelly, served with iceberg lettuce. This dish is a staple at outdoor gatherings and parties.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
