      "amount": "1 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "garlic powder",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "paprika",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together brine, olive oil, salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and paprika.",
    "Add the beef to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated beef onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until charred and cooked through.",
    "While the skewers are cooking, melt the jelly in a small saucepan over low heat.",
    "To serve, place a few pieces of grilled beef onto a bed of iceberg lettuce and drizzle with the melted jelly.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
